      "content": "The Tesla Motors Owner API provides programmatic access to Tesla vehicles for monitoring state data (charge, climate, drive, vehicle config) and executing remote commands (wake up, lock/unlock doors, control climate, manage charging, control trunk, media playback, and more).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Tesla Developer Support",
